---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="About | HDB Kaki"
  description="HDB Kaki is an independent project that turns Singapore's public HDB resale data into clear, honest market insights."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <span class="eyebrow rise"><span class="dot"></span> About</span>
      <h1 class="title rise" style="animation-delay:.05s">
        About <em>HDB Kaki</em>.
      </h1>
      <p class="lede rise" style="animation-delay:.1s">
        A small, independent project that turns Singapore's public HDB resale data into clear,
        honest answers about the market.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <main class="wrap pagepad">
    <div class="prose">
      <h2>What it is</h2>
      <p>
        HDB Kaki helps you stay on top of Singapore's HDB resale market. It pulls together median
        prices, price-per-square-foot trends, town-by-town comparisons, and a tool that estimates
        what a specific flat might be worth against nearby transactions, whether you're buying or
        selling. The goal is to make public data genuinely useful, without the guesswork.
      </p>

      <h2>Who made it</h2>
      <p>
        HDB Kaki is built and maintained by Benjamin Dornel as an independent, personal project. It
        is not a company, and it is not affiliated with the Housing &amp; Development Board (HDB) or
        any government agency.
      </p>

      <h2>How it works</h2>
      <p>
        Everything runs in your browser. The resale dataset is downloaded to your device and queried
        locally, so the tools stay fast and your inputs, including your postal code, never leave
        your machine. There are no accounts, no cookies for tracking, and no analytics. You can read
        more on the <a href="/privacy">privacy page</a>.
      </p>

      <h2 id="data">Where the data comes from</h2>
      <p>
        Prices are based on official HDB resale transaction data. All prices and valuations are
        estimates drawn from past sales and are indicative only. See the
        <a href="/terms">terms of use</a> for the full picture.
      </p>
      <p>
        HDB Kaki is built on these sources. Datasets from <a
          href="https://data.gov.sg"
          rel="noopener"
          target="_blank">data.gov.sg</a
        > are used under the <a
          href="https://data.gov.sg/open-data-licence"
          rel="noopener"
          target="_blank">Singapore Open Data Licence v1.0</a
        >.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          HDB: <a
            href="https://data.gov.sg/datasets/d_8b84c4ee58e3cfc0ece0d773c8ca6abc/view"
            rel="noopener"
            target="_blank">resale flat prices</a
          > and
          <a
            href="https://data.gov.sg/datasets/d_16b157c52ed637edd6ba1232e026258d/view"
            rel="noopener"
            target="_blank">existing buildings</a
          > (data.gov.sg).
        </li>
        <li>
          URA: Master Plan 2019 <a
            href="https://data.gov.sg/datasets/d_4765db0e87b9c86336792efe8a1f7a66/view"
            rel="noopener"
            target="_blank">planning area</a
          > and
          <a
            href="https://data.gov.sg/datasets/d_8594ae9ff96d0c708bc2af633048edfb/view"
            rel="noopener"
            target="_blank">subzone</a
          > boundaries (data.gov.sg).
        </li>
        <li>
          NEA: <a
            href="https://data.gov.sg/datasets/d_4a086da0a5553be1d89383cd90d07ecd/view"
            rel="noopener"
            target="_blank">hawker centres</a
          > (data.gov.sg).
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://www.onemap.gov.sg" rel="noopener" target="_blank">OneMap</a> (Singapore Land
          Authority): block and MRT/LRT station locations.
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://www.sfa.gov.sg" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Singapore Food Agency</a>:
          licensed food outlets.
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright" rel="noopener" target="_blank"
            >© OpenStreetMap contributors</a
          >, available under the <a
            href="https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/"
            rel="noopener"
            target="_blank">ODbL</a
          >: supermarkets and other amenities, and some block locations.
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://carto.com/attributions" rel="noopener" target="_blank">CARTO</a>: map
          tiles.
        </li>
        <li>Wikipedia: locations of announced future MRT stations.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Open source</h2>
      <p>
        The code behind HDB Kaki is open source. You can browse it, report a bug, or suggest an
        improvement on
        <a href="https://github.com/benjamin-awd/hdb-kaki" rel="noopener" target="_blank">GitHub</a
        >.
      </p>

      <h2>Get in touch</h2>
      <p>
        Have feedback or a question? Open an issue on the
        <a href="https://github.com/benjamin-awd/hdb-kaki/issues" rel="noopener" target="_blank"
          >GitHub repository</a
        >.
      </p>
    </div>
  </main>
</Base>
